            </li>
            <li data-state="done">
                <span class="phase__id">P1</span>
                <div>
                    <h2>Deterministic render</h2>
                    <p>
                        One neutral scene IR, motion evaluation, font
                        rasterization, H.264 encoding and repeated runs that
                        produce byte-identical output for the same spec and seed.
                    </p>
