                    </p>
                </div>
            </li>
            <li data-state="open">
                <span class="phase__id">P3</span>
                <div>
                    <h2>Portability gate</h2>
                    <p>
                        Prebuilt natives exist for five host targets, but MP4
                        encoding uses Windows Media Foundation. Linux and macOS
                        can load the package without completing an MP4 render.
                        No date is attached to changing that.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </li>
            <li data-state="open">
                <span class="phase__id">P4</span>
                <div>
                    <h2>Scope gates</h2>
